We use your personal information to pursue our legitimate interests where your rights and freedoms do not outweigh these interests.
We have implemented controls to balance our interests with your rights.
This includes:
       to deliver and target non-behavioral or event based advertising;
        to track user retention and aggregated gameplay information to improve the overall user experience for PeopleFuns products and services;

        to solicit input and feedback to improve PeopleFun products and services and customize your user experience;
        to use general location information to provide you with location based services (such as advertising, search results, and other personalized content);
        to contact you with information that we reasonably believe may be relevant to you; and
        to identify and suggest connections with other PeopleFun users.
